  {
    "id": 1006002010010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー\r\nすぐに取り掛かるよ……ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ペンならこれを使ってくれ\r\n枚数が多いから大変だと思うけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "構わないさ\r\n私のサインを望んでくれる人のためならね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010020"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0170",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ……\r\n横に添えるメッセージは変えても構わないかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、そうしてくれるとありがたい\r\nさすが、咲耶はファンサービスが上手いな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、サービスというつもりは無いのだけれどね\r\n思いついたら、止まらなくなってしまうだけで……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もし、やりすぎの時があったら、\r\n言ってもらえると嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、大丈夫だ\r\nその心配りのおかげでいつも助かっている",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当に？　この間の握手会も……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー、あの時は確かに……\r\n予定の時間をだいぶオーバーしたか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだよ。思い出したかい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私はそういった意味で優等生ではないからね\r\n放っておくと大変なことになるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……しかしそれくらい、\r\n咲耶にとって心を込めるのは自然なことなんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ああ、私そのものと言ってもいいかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "モデル時代には、\r\n私に孤高のイメージを重ねる人もいたけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当はずっと……\r\n仲間や、深い繋がりを求めていたから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600201/1006002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタのおかげで、\r\nようやく今の私になれたんだ……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
